    "sections": {
        "description": "Recruitment is a 100% free, modern WordPress theme designed for job boards, job listing sites, recruitment agencies, staffing agencies, employment agencies, HR teams, and company career pages. It features a clean job‑focused layout, a homepage slider, and flexible feature sections that make it easy to showcase open roles, promote services, and attract both candidates and employers. Whether you're building a job portal, launching a recruitment agency website, or creating an internal careers page, Recruitment gives you a fast, professional foundation optimised for hiring and job‑posting workflows."
